@startuml
title AQUA-DRIFT Component Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "simulation-clock" as Clock
component "target-simulator" as Target
component "observer-001..100" as Observer
component "current-field" as Field
component "doppler-engine" as Doppler
component "estimator\n(online / smoothed)" as Estimator
database "PostgreSQL + PostGIS" as DB
component "API / WebSocket" as API
component "CesiumJS / CZML" as GIS

Clock --> Target : synchronized 1 s tick
Clock --> Observer : synchronized 1 s tick
Field --> Target : affine current
Field --> Observer : passive drift
Target --> Doppler : synthetic truth
Observer --> Doppler : exact position/depth
Doppler --> Estimator : Doppler observation
Observer --> Estimator : position/depth history
Estimator --> API
Target --> API
Observer --> API
API --> DB
API --> GIS : WebSocket snapshot

note bottom of Estimator
No bearing information is used.
Absolute position is not asserted
when it is unobservable.
end note
@enduml
